FulfillRedeemRoundingIntegrationConcreteTest
├── when the reservation does not divide evenly across two partials
│   ├── it should floor the first slice
│   └── it should pay the exact remainder on the last slice
├── when the entry is drained one share at a time
│   └── it should pay exactly the reservation in total
├── when the reservation is below the share count
│   └── it should conserve the reservation across partials
├── when the entry accumulated requests at two prices
│   └── it should conserve the combined reservation across partials
├── when a slice's proportional reservation floors to zero
│   ├── it should refuse the slice
│   └── it should settle a slice that carries a wei
├── when fulfilled at the unchanged current price after a partial
│   └── it should not trip the guard
├── when fulfilled partially at a dropped current price
│   ├── it should pay the floored pro-rata current value
│   └── it should release the floored pro-rata reservation
├── when an accumulated entry is settled at the unchanged current price
│   ├── it should refuse by the per-request rounding slack
│   └── it should settle at the request price instead
└── when the last slice is one share
    └── it should pay the exact remainder
